{"ns": "dsh-market", "key": "hostIncompatibleFoundUpdate", "en": "You can update to {version} — it declares support for this DSH.", "ru": null, "zh": "可以更新到 {version}：它声明兼容当前 DSH。", "source": "dshmarket"}
{"ns": "dsh-market", "key": "hostIncompatibleHeldTarget", "en": "{version} does declare support for this DSH, but it is still inside the release-age wait — a new release has to settle for {window} hours, so about {hours} more to go.", "ru": null, "zh": "可以选 {version}：它声明兼容当前 DSH，但还在发布等待期——新版本发布后要等 {window} 小时才算稳定，还差约 {hours} 小时。", "source": "dshmarket"}
