{"ns": "dsh-market", "key": "hostIncompatibleBodyInstall", "en": "{plugin} declares that it needs DSH {requirement}, and you are running {host}. Installing it would most likely break the plugin.\nNothing was installed.\nIf you know the version number is wrong (a bundled DSH that does not report one, for example), you can install anyway.", "ru": null, "zh": "{plugin} 声明需要 DSH {requirement}，而你现在运行的是 {host}。装上去很可能用不了。\n已停止，没有安装任何东西。\n如果你确定这个版本号不准（例如桌面端自带的 DSH 不报告版本），仍可继续安装。", "source": "dshmarket"}
