{"ns": "dsh-market", "key": "webdavAutoBackupPaused", "en": "Daily backup could not run: this server needs a password, and the password is never stored, so it has to be entered again after a reload. Enter it and press Upload backup.", "ru": null, "zh": "每天自动备份没能完成：这个服务需要密码认证，而密码不会保存到磁盘，刷新或重启后要重新输入。填好后点「上传备份」即可。", "source": "dshmarket"}
{"ns": "dsh-market", "key": "webdavPathHint", "en": "Give the whole file path, name included: the backup writes that file and restore reads it back. With automatic backup on it uploads at most once a day.", "ru": null, "zh": "填完整的文件地址（含文件名）：备份写进这个文件，恢复也从它读。开启自动备份后每天最多上传一次。", "source": "dshmarket"}
